\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath: A Curated Collection of Open Mathematics Problems, record 5100025 (AMR-050-0025). CC BY 4.0. \url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Dan Reznik, Ronaldo Garcia and Jair Koiller, \emph{Eighty New Invariants in the Elliptic Billiard}, arXiv:2004.12497v11 (29 October 2020), \S3.5, Table 5, pp. 6--7. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/2004.12497v11}.
